; ---------------------------------------------------------
; VNKit 2.12 — Phone Gameplay API demo
;   * @phonehub — free phone phase, released by the «Continue» button
;   * @chatActions — contextual action buttons inside a chat
;   * @msg id: — message states (message.<id>.received / .read / .answered)
;   * @note / @schedule / @gallery — phone apps as gameplay tools
;   * @phoneGame — mini-games framed as phone apps (stats → phoneGame.*)
;   * @phoneapp — hide/show home screen apps
;   * affection.rin / trust.rin — relationships via dotted variables
; Enable "Use Placeholder Graphics" to run this without any art.
; ---------------------------------------------------------

# Start

@bg Campus time:0.8
@bgm ThemeDay fade:1.5
@phoneOn
@set affection.rin=0, trust.rin=0

The school day is over. The phone in your pocket is heavier than usual —
today it is not a toy, it is a tool.

; --- Silent pre-fill: the chat already has history (notify:0 → no toast).
; The second message carries id:rin_invite — its state is trackable:
; message.rin_invite.received is 1 from this moment on.
@msg chat:rin notify:0 from:"Rin" "You're coming to the roof today, right?"
@msg chat:rin notify:0 id:rin_invite from:"Rin" "I dug up something about Elysium. Ask me when you have a minute."

; --- Notes: the player reads them in the Notes app. star = important mark.
@note add "Rin dug up something about «Elysium»." id:n1
@note add "Buy coffee on the way back." id:n2
@note star id:n2

; --- Schedule: upcoming events with times.
@schedule add time:"18:00" title:"Roof — meeting with Rin" id:ev1
@schedule add time:"21:00" title:"Dorm curfew" id:ev2

; --- Gallery: a photo with meta (sender / date / location / description / tag).
@gallery add cg/roof_sky sender:"Rin" date:"May 12" location:"Roof" desc:"The sky from the roof — her photo." tag:rin important:1

; --- Relationships are ordinary dotted variables — no new systems.
; Contacts tab shows affection.<id> / trust.<id> once they are non-zero.
@set affection.rin=1, trust.rin=1

; --- Rin comes online with a pending LIVE dialogue (@online ... goto:).
; And the chat gets CONTEXTUAL ACTIONS — buttons the player can tap while
; the script is parked. "Ask about Elysium" appears only after the player
; has READ the tracked message (message.rin_invite.read == true).
@online chat:rin contact:"Rin 🌸" goto:RinTalk
@chatActions chat:rin "Ask about Elysium" goto:AskElysium if:message.rin_invite.read == true do:affection.rin+=1 | "Send a sticker" goto:Sticker

Rin's icon lights up online. The phone is yours: Chats, Contacts, Notes,
Schedule, Gallery, Games.

; --- FREE PHONE PHASE: the script waits here until the player presses
; «Continue» on the chat list. Live dialogues and chat actions work inside.
@phonehub

; --- Back to the script. Branch on the MESSAGE STATE:
; did the player answer Rin's tracked message (via the live dialogue
; or an action — any outgoing bubble counts)?
@if message.rin_invite.answered == true goto:WasAnswered
You never answered Rin's message. She will remember that.
@goto AfterHub

# WasAnswered
Rin got her answer. That matters to her.
@set trust.rin+=1

# AfterHub

; --- Reactive messaging: the follow-up depends on the relationship value.
@if affection.rin >= 2 goto:LikesYou
@msg chat:rin from:"Rin" "You could at least pretend to be interested."
@goto DemoEnd

# LikesYou
@msg chat:rin from:"Rin" "…thanks for listening. Really."

# DemoEnd

; --- @phoneGame: a mini-game as a phone app. Stats land in
; phoneGame.Lockpick.plays / .last; var: works like @minigame.
The old storage room door has a padlock. Like an app on your phone,
the lockpick game opens full-screen.
@phoneGame Lockpick var:lockResult
@if lockResult == 1 goto:Won
The pick broke. (phoneGame.Lockpick.last = 0 — the Games tab remembers.)
@goto WrapUp

# Won
Unlocked! (phoneGame.Lockpick.plays grew too.)

# WrapUp

; --- @phoneapp hides/shows home screen apps.
@phoneapp games off
The Games app vanishes from the home screen…
@phoneapp games on
…and it is back.

The demo is over. Everything you saw — notes, schedule, gallery,
chat actions, message states, phone games — lives in the save file
and survives rollback.

@phoneOff
@end

; ---------------------------------------------------------
# RinTalk
Rin: You're here!
Rin: So — the roof at six. Don't be late.
{playerName}: I'll be there, promise.
@chatend

# AskElysium
Rin: Oh, so you read that. Look — the archive mentions a program
Rin: called «Elysium». I'll send you the photo tonight.
@chatend

# Sticker
{playerName}: [sticker]
Rin: lol
@chatend
